<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 104 0 R/T(The assignment followed thesequenceinterpret,designfileprocessing,anticipate failures, organise into modules, implement, trace, challenge,refine. The main lessons: \(1\) always use with and process files line by line; \(2\) catch specific exceptions andlog what was rejected instead of hiding it; \(3\) append or write modes must be chosen deliberately andnewlines written explicitly; \(4\) modules and packages reduce the cost of change and namingconflicts; \(5\)the right data structure \(dictionary, set\) changes complexity from O\(s x f x l\) or O\(n^2\) to O\(fxl\) or O\(n\).)/E(The assignment followed thesequenceinterpret,designfileprocessing,anticipate failures, organise into modules, implement, trace, challenge,refine. The main lessons: \(1\) always use with and process files line by line; \(2\) catch specific exceptions andlog what was rejected instead of hiding it; \(3\) append or write modes must be chosen deliberately andnewlines written explicitly; \(4\) modules and packages reduce the cost of change and namingconflicts; \(5\)the right data structure \(dictionary, set\) changes complexity from O\(s x f x l\) or O\(n^2\) to O\(fxl\) or O\(n\).)/Pg 34 0 R/K[4]>>
