2369 0 obj
<</Title(Both are O\(n\) in time, and the measuredtimes are of the same order \(the differences aresmall andvary between runs\). The real difference is memory: iteration is O\(1\) in the line length, the alternative is O\(file size\). For 50,000 lines the alternative used roughly 180-240 times more memory, and thegap growswith the file. Reading everything is acceptable only for small files that must be processed morethan once.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2251 0 R/Prev 2488 0 R/First 2489 0 R/Last 2490 0 R/Count -2>>
endobj

