2550 0 obj
<</Title(line format - because that is where the rule is broken, and the message says exactly what is wrong. It is handled in summarise\(\) \(the loop that reads the file\), because only that function knows the line number and can decide to count the line as an error and continue. A custom exception separates data errors \(skip the line\) from system errors such as FileNotFoundError \(skip the file\) and from real bugs \(let them stop the program\).)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2532 0 R/Prev 2565 0 R>>
endobj

